{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12243050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12243050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1224305001:1":{"text":"다들 누가 돌아왔는지 좀 보세요!","source_cn":"各位，看看谁回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E417CBAC8D6EFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224305002:0":{"text":"신밧드, 너 이 녀석, 이렇게 오랜만에 오다니.","source_cn":"辛巴达，你这孩子，这么久才回来一趟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC02548CF9C41E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224305003:1":{"text":"우리의 <male>은인</male><female>은인</female>도 오셨네요? 그리고 이 분은...","source_cn":"恩人<male>先生</male><female>小姐...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF6FA59079302505","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리의 <male>은인</male><female>은인</female>도 오셨네요? 그리고 이 분은...","female":"우리의 <male>은인</male><female>은인</female>도 오셨네요? 그리고 이 분은...","variant_male_record_index":"139364","variant_female_record_index":"139365","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224305004:1":{"text":"...저예요, 벨라.","source_cn":"……是我，贝拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0340D6EC37AE4A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224305005:1":{"text":"벨라... 정말 너구나! 내가 잘못 본 줄로만 알았어...","source_cn":"贝拉……真是你！我还以为是自己认错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95E530A6A78A6428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224305006:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈가 우리 스몰워터 마을엔 왜 온 거지?","source_cn":"你一个血薇帮，来小水村做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C457E685DF85B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224305007:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈에서는 출항할 배를 지키는 일을 여러분께 부탁드리려고 해요.","source_cn":"血薇帮想请你们帮忙，维护出航的船只。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B2898477DAE919A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224305008:0":{"text":"어림도 없으니 쓸데없는 말 하지 말고 썩 물러가!","source_cn":"别浪费口舌了，我告诉你，没门！你走吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C9EF88FC962D92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224305009:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈는 지금 러스트 항의 화물 무역을 재개하기 위해서 부두를 재건하고 있어요.","source_cn":"血薇帮正在重建码头，目的是恢复锈锚港的贸易货运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC002F3F724F20D90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224305010:1":{"text":"이건 모두에게 좋은 일이니 잘 생각해 보시는 게 좋을 거예요.","source_cn":"这是对大家都好的事，你们应该好好考虑一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49F73097236EA4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1224305011:1":{"text":"과거의 일은 이미 지나갔으니 사적인 원한에 영향을 받지 마시...","source_cn":"以前的事都过去了，你们不要受私人恩怨影响——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AFE2DBAA3604206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1224305012:0":{"text":"...닥쳐!","source_cn":"——闭嘴！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A6D72DB33271D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1224305013:0":{"text":"전에도 말했다시피, 우린 절대 블러디 로즈를 도울 수 없어!","source_cn":"我早就说过，我们绝对不可能帮血薇帮做事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FCDD048193C6D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1224305014:0":{"text":"테시오가 자리에서 끌어내려 지고, 감옥에 갇히고, 재판을 받더라도 그 사실은 변하지 않을 테니 단념해!","source_cn":"即使泰西欧被拉下马，即使他被关押、被审判，这件事也不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8786B51B40119AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1224305015:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1224305016:1":{"text":"휴... 타샤의 말이 좀 듣기 거북하긴 하지만 사실이니... 이만 돌아가.","source_cn":"唉……塔莎的话是难听了点，但理是这个理。你回去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89058B10875C1450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1224305017:0":{"text":"마을 사람들이... 너무 단칼에 거절하시는데요!","source_cn":"村民们……拒绝得也太干脆了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD715E608E770C4ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1224305018:1":{"text":"제 착각인가요? 다들 벨라를 대하는 태도가 조금 이상한 것 같아요...","source_cn":"是我的错觉吗？大家对贝拉的态度好像有点奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E8A443E706CAB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1224305018":{"text":"제 착각인가요? 다들 벨라를 대하는 태도가 조금 이상한 것 같아요...","source_cn":"是我的错觉吗？大家对贝拉的态度好像有点奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E8A443E706CAB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1224305019:1":{"text":"아, 신밧드도 벨라랑 안지 오래되었다고 했잖아요.","source_cn":"唔，辛巴达也说过，他认识贝拉很多年了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5E824CEC803D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1224305020:1":{"text":"치피 생각엔, 두 사람은 분명 아는 사이일 거예요!","source_cn":"满满猜，他们肯定认识！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB50B39B3C1168E5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1224305021:1":{"text":"그렇게 간단한 사이가 아닐 거야...","source_cn":"肯定不仅是认识这么简单啦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F347A205381EC91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1224305022:0":{"text":"...제게 제안이 하나 있어요.","source_cn":"……我还有一个提议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66734BED570B3783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1224305023:1":{"text":"듣고 싶지 않으니, 어서 가!","source_cn":"不想听！你走吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0873BB54236DCCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1224305024:1":{"text":"만약 테시오의 재판을 거래 조건으로 내걸면요?","source_cn":"如果以泰西欧的审判作为交换条件呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6EB6FF3208B7666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1224305025:1":{"text":"...그게 무슨 말이지?","source_cn":"……你什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4EB628E8D3FCA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1224305026:1":{"text":"테시오는 곧 재판을 받게 될 예정이에요. 여러분은 법정에 출두해 증언을 할 수도 있고, 미리 의사당으로 가서 그가 유리의 함대를 죽였다고 증언을 남길 수도 있죠.","source_cn":"泰西欧即将被审判，你们可以出庭作证，也可以提前到议事厅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9177A23F4199C311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1224305027:1":{"text":"저도 두목과 부두목께 말씀드려 유리 아저씨와 그의 함대의 이름을 바로잡을 거고요.","source_cn":"我也会请老大和二当家做主，给尤里叔叔他们正名。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D879541392DDA36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1224305028:1":{"text":"...그렇게 되면 유리 아저씨들의 누명은 벗겨질 테고, 여러분들도 더 이상 사람들에게 질타받지 않아도 될 거예요.","source_cn":"……这样的话，尤里叔叔他们就能洗刷冤屈，你们也不会再被骂了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91A014C40DA7DCAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1224305029:1":{"text":"그 말에 책임질 수 있어?","source_cn":"你说话作数吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06934BD5E75E63DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1224305030:1":{"text":"전 이미 부두목 루카의 조수에요.","source_cn":"我已经是二当家卢卡的副手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x608E3529BCAEBB75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1224305031:1":{"text":"...나 혼자서는 결정할 수 없으니 마을의 자매들이랑 상의를 해봐야 해. 여기서 기다려.","source_cn":"……我一个人不能做决定，要和村里的姐妹商量一下。你等着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A4A395E3F8E868C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1224305032:1":{"text":"신밧드, 너도 이리 와!","source_cn":"辛巴达，你也过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF498CF5CC24EC878","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:52:1224305033:0":{"text":"스몰워터 마을의 마을 사람들은 한데 모여 아주 오랫동안 이야기를 나누었다...","source_cn":"小水村的村民们聚在一起，商量了很久很久……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4119BBBB7153B0A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:0:1":{"text":"벨라를 잘 아는 것 같아","source_cn":"她们似乎和贝拉很熟悉","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x94D0D7FC1E90EBFE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"벨라를 잘 아는 것 같아","female":"벨라를 잘 아는 것 같아","variant_male_record_index":"67368","variant_female_record_index":"67369","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:1:2":{"text":"그들은 블러디 로즈를 증오하지만 벨라를 쫓아내진 않았어","source_cn":"她们憎恶血薇帮，却没有把贝拉赶走","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99668A9B07C5E809","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그들은 블러디 로즈를 증오하지만 벨라를 쫓아내진 않았어","female":"그들은 블러디 로즈를 증오하지만 벨라를 쫓아내진 않았어","variant_male_record_index":"67370","variant_female_record_in